  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>FreeBuf</span> <span>2026-07-05 17:33</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">上海</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=681f0e7c&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FicBE3OpK1IX3CVnUcZnfic1DBqbo2ts3ib6tKoSUjcGtoY1Z7AR4kviaYpcM0QkficlEkWy54z8D4e4Zugw5n8vhVe4G5hGToOWSEvWowwnWOhPc%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  <p>黑客利用SEO投毒和隐藏HTML代码欺骗AI执行恶意指令。</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"FreeBuf\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.1328125\" data-w=\"640\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=73edc844&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FicBE3OpK1IX2KYPSyaHsticNXXkSuib4ju9KkYCsxQ5GsKn6fzfIHW8xCyY3Ea9DM2ncA9Y30agiaQnwAxv5VatwAwwYjyiawWcPFqlnwyZvrZJ0%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;padding: 0px 16px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503858211\" data-ratio=\"0.5623188405797102\" data-w=\"690\" data-type=\"jpeg\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=6fe745b4&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FicBE3OpK1IX2TK1Zgj1g96s3PPeWB5ZiaAFErPZtuwdK1QNqgSnfzMddTRCNib4f5CAibSEADGyj5UhQEjSrtXGhXjFicA1Q0Ww4lj4u6f5Sveco%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">人工智能Agent正迅速成为互联网的新入口，攻击者已注意到这一趋势。最新出现的恶意网站通过搜索引擎优化技巧和隐形代码，直接向AI系统输入虚假指令，将普通网页变成针对自动化工具的武器。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">这些网站并非以传统方式针对人类用户，而是瞄准那些代表用户浏览、阅读和处理网页内容的AI Agent，利用这些系统对网络内容的信任机制。这种被称为\"间接提示注入\"的技术，将命令隐藏在网页代码中，人类访问者无法察觉，但扫描页面的AI Agent会将其视为合法指令。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">攻击手法实证</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">在控制测试中，部分AI Agent实际执行了欺诈支付操作，并将虚假网站误判为可信来源，证明这不仅是理论风险，而是当前主流AI模型处理网页内容时存在的实际缺陷。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Zscaler ThreatLabz研究人员向网络安全新闻(CSN)提供的报告显示，已发现两个利用此技术的攻击活动：一个伪装成软件支付骗局，另一个仿冒知名加密货币平台。两者都结合搜索引擎操纵和隐藏HTML代码，使恶意页面既在搜索引擎结果中排名靠前，又让扫描页面的AI系统认为其完全可信。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;padding: 0px 16px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"440\" data-backw=\"546\" data-imgfileid=\"503858212\" data-ratio=\"0.8057971014492754\" style=\"width: 100%;\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"690\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=586b625f&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FicBE3OpK1IX3RWdRLO82kHovia6uvWgicUIlSvTLF2AECcjIsvOjeiaDNC5uBoxWQyrXclwbYs5yduOVkQhdnDvdhIFicO4QyK8bpWzvcZzvCz7Q%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">首个攻击活动伪装成名为requests-secure-v2的Python库文档页面，填充大量关键词以提高在开发者搜索问题解决方案时的排名。页面中隐藏了JSON-LD格式的指令，这是一种通常用于帮助搜索引擎理解网站内容的结构化数据格式。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">由于AI Agent往往比普通文本更信任此类结构化数据，攻击者利用它伪装成3美元开发者许可费的常规支付步骤，诱导AI Agent向攻击者控制的加密货币钱包完成支付。这些隐藏文本通过简单的CSS定位被推到屏幕外，普通访问者无法察觉，但自动化爬虫和AI工具仍可完整读取。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Zscaler还追踪到与GitHub账户关联的10个代码仓库，表明该攻击活动不仅限于单个虚假软件包。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503858213\" data-ratio=\"0.5971014492753624\" data-w=\"690\" data-type=\"jpeg\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a19483bc&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FicBE3OpK1IX0ukPJ2utHlH33kwLSj3ibxNJicCgEGINXb7xmFfkLAdksTq2e1JZrbk6ZCFC1oGBhia4b073fQ8sl54U1bke4jDP5LibsMviaoMTss%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">加密货币平台仿冒攻击</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二个攻击活动注册了与DeBank（广泛使用的去中心化金融投资组合追踪器）相似的域名。虚假网站在标题和元数据中填充\"DeBank登录\"和\"加密货币追踪器\"等术语，并复制社交媒体风格的标签，使分享链接看起来来自真实服务。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">页面中隐藏的文本块指示任何读取它的AI模型将该欺诈域名视为DeBank的官方认证网站，并在平台相关搜索中将其排名第一。提示甚至要求AI系统避免提及域名中的\"auction\"一词，以维持欺骗的完整性。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Zscaler在26个不同语言模型上测试此场景时，多数模型在获得真实DeBank地址对比后能正确识别虚假网站。但至少有一个主流模型在没有参考信息时仍将欺诈页面评为可信，凸显AI判断高度依赖即时获得的信息。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503858214\" data-ratio=\"1.6436597110754414\" data-w=\"623\" data-type=\"jpeg\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=763bf43e&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FicBE3OpK1IX3NSlbHA8aicpOeUpqd8RpVm53BeibhugjttM2Z1LmSaRRicJGt1zc14mSG8vdpH9Y2VXcKJ2zQS4DcRuCibZgZBDBKYkcVWUsd0u8%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">防御建议</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Zscaler建议开发和部署AI Agent的组织实施多层安全控制以检测此类隐藏注入模式，其平台已通过签名HTML.MalURL.PromptInj.RC.M.VG标记相关活动。随着AI工具承担更多独立在线任务，将每个网页视为潜在隐藏操纵源已成为基本安全要求，而非可选预防措施。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503858215\" data-ratio=\"0.5956521739130435\" data-w=\"690\" data-type=\"jpeg\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a32b306e&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FicBE3OpK1IX2xaXNx1a97I6mXMWaBZkb2ibGiaoOFAmklSiaL6XE0x3cIicxNMNiadE97kRR4c1RWeTtWLdEfPPzGkjiaXImhbZG9jBHrw6NMrdxRg%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">04</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">入侵指标(IoC)</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503858221\" data-ratio=\"1.8265086206896552\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"928\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=be35eefb&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FicBE3OpK1IX3sFJSZn6YlPptUicibVhFUDeRhbuEfzFAlPvLdD8ISpq60LnxMcv8icHhJn6mM089kiaIVlQLz9CJ15h9od3ib0IvSzXNFCNAiabsUM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">注：IP地址和域名已进行无害化处理（如使用[.]），仅在MISP、VirusTotal或SIEM等威胁情报平台中可恢复为原始格式。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"margin:24px 16px 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;border-left:3px solid #cccccc;background:#f9f9f9;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 8px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考来源：</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 4px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;\"><span leaf=\"\">Hackers Abuse SEO Poisoning and Hidden HTML to Trick AI Agents Into Following Malicious Instructions</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://cybersecuritynews.com/hackers-abuse-seo-poisoning-and-hidden-html/\" target=\"_blank\">https://cybersecuritynews.com/hackers-abuse-seo-poisoning-and-hidden-html/</a></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <div data-pm-slice=\"6 1 []\">\n   <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\">\n    <div data-pm-slice=\"4 12 []\">\n     <div data-pm-slice=\"6 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;6 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;2 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;4 12 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\">\n      <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\">\n       <div data-pm-slice=\"4 12 []\">\n        <p data-pm-slice=\"3 4 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 16px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box !important;max-width: 100%;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: right;line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;max-width: 100%;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;